{"id":"n25692-1-2","stage":3,"title":"부 · 场","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25692-1-2-1","ko":"학예회에서 지수는 언제쯤 나오는 거야?","zh":"学校文艺汇演中，智秀大概什么时候出场？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학예회에서","meaning":"学艺展示会，才艺表演会","explanation":"학예회：学艺展示会，才艺表演会；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"학예회","audio":"/audio/6d29556c8803482c2f30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83986","senseId":"1","lemma":"학예회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"언제쯤","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나오는","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거：所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d29556c8803482c","term":"학예회","zh":"学艺展示会，才艺表演会","audio":"/audio/6d29556c8803482c2f30.mp3","entryId":"83986","definition":"一种特别教育活动，主要展示学生的作品或表演准备好的节目等。","pronunciation":["하계회","하계훼"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出场，参加","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在某处现身。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/fa88870d096072a104b7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25692-1-2-2","ko":"지수네 반의 연극은 학예회 이 부의 첫 순서래.","zh":"听说智秀班上的话剧是汇演第二部分的第一个节目。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수네","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；네：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"지수네","audio":"/audio/df41be8cbe5f604719bb.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"반의","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연극은","meaning":"话剧，戏剧","explanation":"연극：话剧，戏剧；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"연극","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13977","senseId":"1","lemma":"연극","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학예회","meaning":"学艺展示会，才艺表演会","explanation":"학예회：学艺展示会，才艺表演会","readings":[{"term":"학예회","audio":"/audio/6d29556c8803482c2f30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83986","senseId":"1","lemma":"학예회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"牙齿","explanation":"이：牙齿","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69529","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부의","meaning":"场，幕","explanation":"부：场，幕；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"부","audio":"/audio/0a468f0864a0ff7e05c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25692","senseId":"1","lemma":"부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"첫","meaning":"首次，初次，第一次","explanation":"첫：首次，初次，第一次","readings":[{"term":"첫","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77610","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"순서래.","meaning":"次序","explanation":"순서：次序；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；래：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"순서","audio